{"id":23220,"author":"Cyclops","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eServer Info:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/2b210ed35\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/2b210ed35\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none;\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/2b210ed35\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eDate \u0026amp; Time: \u003cb\u003eMonday,\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;July 18th\u0026nbsp;/ 12:00PM EST\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eScenarios:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eSoul Brothers:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, HelveticaNeue, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eBefore the game, 3 worlds would have to be prepared (let's call them UHC1, UHC2, UHC3). Worlds UHC1 and UHC2 would have the same seed, UHC3 does not. Nether would be off.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, HelveticaNeue, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eOne teammate is scattered in world UHC1 and the other one in UHC2 (with different starting positions). They can tell each other where the ores could be found, where's a mineshaft etc. Obviously, they can die during this period to pvp/pve.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, HelveticaNeue, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eAfter 1 hour, all players would be rescattered in the 3rd world (as a team, now reunited) and game would progress normally.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eRewarding Longshots:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003eWhen shooting and hitting people with an arrow from a variable distance, you will be rewarded with various different items.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0.35714285714285715em 0px 0.7142857142857143em; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.4285714285714286em;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0.35714285714285715em 0px 0.7142857142857143em; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em !important; line-height: 1.4285714285714286em;\"\u003e30-49 Block Longshots: 1 iron ingot\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.4285714285714286em;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0.35714285714285715em 0px 0.7142857142857143em; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em !important; line-height: 1.4285714285714286em;\"\u003e50-99 Block Longshots: 1 iron ingot + 1 gold ingot\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.4285714285714286em;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0.35714285714285715em 0px 0.7142857142857143em; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em !important; line-height: 1.4285714285714286em;\"\u003e100 - 199 Block Longshots: 1 diamond + 1 gold ingot + 1 iron ingot\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.4285714285714286em;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0.35714285714285715em 0px 0.7142857142857143em; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em !important; line-height: 1.4285714285714286em;\"\u003e200+ Block Longshots: 5 diamonds + 3 gold ingots + 2 iron ingots\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eParanoia:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u003eWhen mining diamond or gold, healing or taking damage, making an enchantment table or anvil, your cords will be broadcasted in chat.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cu\u003eRandom Teams of 4\u003c/u\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspa